    "method": "Staged reconstruction of the source's simplest analysis: infer the non-quenchable phase's ambient volume by the cited Jeanloz G-versus-g extrapolation, reduce hot volumes to the 300 K reference with the paper's constant zero-pressure volumetric expansivity, then fit a pooled BM2 with V0 and K0-prime fixed.",
