     "law": "V_ref = V_T * exp[-alpha0 * (T - Tr)]",
     "source_scope": "alpha0 is the paper's zero-pressure goethite result; it is used only to reproduce the epsilon fit reduction and is not stored as an epsilon thermal EOS coefficient."
